{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tired of the tedious task of wielding a shovel and the hard labor of a rookie gold prospector?We've got the perfect solution! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This add-on makes life easier, especially for novice miners. The mini-machines are more affordable than the larger ones, making them a great choice in the early stages of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mini Mining is a set of four compact devices: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Excavator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wash Plant</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Mini Excavator</strong> - enhance your work on the plot, getting the job done much faster than with a shovel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900730/extras/1b.gif?t=1740040683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini Drilling Machine </strong>- with smaller, cheaper drill, you can get straight into rich spot seeking </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900730/extras/2b.gif?t=1740040683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini Front-end Loader </strong>- load excavated material, faster and more efficiently. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900730/extras/3b.gif?t=1740040683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mini Wash Plant</strong> \u2013 the simplest of the wash plants systems, fully automated and mounted on a handy trailer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900730/extras/4b.gif?t=1740040683\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After you purchase DLC your Mini Mining Machines will be available to 